@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness] derived-menu-auditions
Menu auditions MUST be separate replaceable derived products, never runtime cue
replacements. Their producer MUST read actual verified bank/legacy media, pin the
runtime gain/pitch/envelope profile, use the same timeline across banks and record
source hashes. Cadence MUST explicitly remain an animation-plant approximation.
All inputs MUST validate before output writes and be rechecked before publishing
the derived index. Missing or stale products MUST fail the normal build; runtime
consumers MUST require its successful current certification.
